---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-10 md:py-14">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-6">About</h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Luke here. I'm a software engineer who enjoys building projects using many
      different technologies. You can find some of my work on
      <a href="https://github.com/lukebrown14-code" class="text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 hover:underline">GitHub</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      I started this blog as a way to think more clearly. Writing forces me to
      slow down with an idea — to pull it apart and put it back together — in a
      way that reading alone doesn't.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      The name Archipelago comes from the image of islands scattered across open
      water. Each post is its own island: a standalone idea from a book, a
      philosophical concept, or a reflection on how we live. Over time, they form
      a loose constellation — separate but connected.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      You'll find book notes, philosophy, technology, and the occasional essay on
      culture and other ideas that interest me. Nothing too polished, just honest
      thinking.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
